fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gst-rtsp-server/rtsp-onvif-media-factory.html#GstRTSPOnvifMediaFactoryClass::create_backchannel_stream","fragment":"\n\tcreate_backchannel_stream\n\n\n\tvfunc_create_backchannel_stream\n\n\n\tdo_create_backchannel_stream\n\nCalled by the factory from construct(). The default implementation\ncreates the * GstRTSPStream for the backchannel receiver by calling\ngst_rtsp_onvif_media_collect_backchannel (media). Implementations\nthat want to create the backchannel later should return TRUE here\nand call gst_rtsp_onvif_media_collect_backchannel later, but must\ndo so before the media finishes preparing.\nParameters:\na GstRTSPOnvifMediaFactory\na GstRTSPOnvifMedia\na GstRTSPContext\nTRUE on success. FALSE on a fatal error.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nCalled by the factory from vfunc_construct(). The default implementation\ncreates the * GstRtspServer.RTSPStream for the backchannel receiver by calling\ngst_rtsp_onvif_media_collect_backchannel (media). Implementations\nthat want to create the backchannel later should return TRUE here\nand call GstRtspServer.RTSPOnvifMedia.prototype.collect_backchannel later, but must\ndo so before the media finishes preparing.\nParameters:\na GstRtspServer.RTSPOnvifMediaFactory\na GstRtspServer.RTSPOnvifMedia\na GstRtspServer.RTSPContext\nTRUE on success. FALSE on a fatal error.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nCalled by the factory from do_construct(). The default implementation\ncreates the * GstRtspServer.RTSPStream for the backchannel receiver by calling\ngst_rtsp_onvif_media_collect_backchannel (media). Implementations\nthat want to create the backchannel later should return TRUE here\nand call GstRtspServer.RTSPOnvifMedia.collect_backchannel later, but must\ndo so before the media finishes preparing.\nParameters:\na GstRtspServer.RTSPOnvifMediaFactory\na GstRtspServer.RTSPOnvifMedia\na GstRtspServer.RTSPContext\nTRUE on success. FALSE on a fatal error.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});